---
title: Imaginary Circles
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Imaginary Circles</title>
<meta name="description" content="A graphical story of how the Euclidean circle becomes the language of astronomy, waves, Fourier analysis, and quantum mechanics.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg: hsl(212, 23%, 6%);
    --bg-elevated: hsl(210, 22%, 10%);
    --line: hsl(199, 18%, 25%);
    --line-soft: hsl(204, 18%, 15%);
    --ink: hsl(42, 31%, 91%);
    --ink-dim: hsl(42, 13%, 65%);
    --ink-faint: hsl(42, 10%, 44%);
    --accent: hsl(190, 62%, 61%);
    --accent-b: hsl(43, 75%, 68%);
    --warm: hsl(34, 72%, 62%);
    --violet: hsl(262, 38%, 70%);
    --chalk: hsla(42, 31%, 91%, 0.72);
    --accent-glow: hsla(190, 62%, 61%, 0.18);
    --display: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    --mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html,body{background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink);}
  body{
    padding:72px 24px 100px;
    font-family:var(--mono);
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  .page{max-width:1160px; margin:0 auto;}

  .hero{
    min-height:calc(100dvh - 170px);
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:minmax(0, 0.92fr) minmax(420px, 1.08fr);
    gap:54px;
    align-items:center;
    padding-bottom:42px;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:0.18em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--accent);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{content:''; width:22px; height:1px; background:var(--accent);}
  h1{
    font-family:var(--display);
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:clamp(42px,7vw,88px);
    letter-spacing:-0.02em;
    line-height:0.96;
    max-width:680px;
    margin-bottom:24px;
  }
  h1 span{color:var(--accent-b);}
  .tagline{
    font-family:var(--display);
    font-style:italic;
    font-weight:500;
    font-size:clamp(21px,2.8vw,30px);
    color:var(--ink);
    line-height:1.25;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    max-width:650px;
    margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  .sub{
    font-family:var(--display);
    font-size:16.5px;
    color:var(--ink-dim);
    max-width:690px;
    line-height:1.65;
  }
  .hero-actions{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:12px;
    margin-top:30px;
  }
  .hero-action{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    min-height:44px;
    border:1px solid hsla(199, 92%, 62%, 0.34);
    border-radius:8px;
    padding:0 16px;
    color:var(--ink);
    text-decoration:none;
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:13px;
    font-weight:600;
    background:hsla(199, 92%, 62%, 0.08);
    transition:transform .18s ease, border-color .18s ease, background .18s ease;
  }
  .hero-action:hover{
    transform:translateY(-2px);
    border-color:var(--accent);
    background:hsla(199, 92%, 62%, 0.14);
  }
  .hero-action.secondary{
    border-color:hsla(210, 40%, 72%, 0.14);
    color:var(--ink-dim);
    background:hsla(215, 28%, 13%, 0.74);
  }
  .hero-action.secondary:hover{color:var(--ink);}

  .story-board{
    position:relative;
    min-height:520px;
    border:1px solid hsla(42, 31%, 91%, 0.14);
    border-radius:8px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(145deg, hsla(207, 24%, 12%, 0.56), hsla(214, 28%, 7%, 0.82));
    box-shadow:0 28px 70px -44px hsla(34, 60%, 10%, 0.8);
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .story-board::before{
    content:'';
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, hsla(212, 23%, 6%, 0.86), hsla(212, 23%, 6%, 0.22) 42%, transparent 68%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 16% 18%, hsla(190, 62%, 61%, 0.12), transparent 34%);
    z-index:1;
  }
  .story-board::after{
    content:'';
    position:absolute;
    inset:18px;
    border:1px solid hsla(42, 31%, 91%, 0.10);
    border-radius:8px;
    pointer-events:none;
    z-index:3;
  }
  .story-image{
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    object-fit:cover;
    object-position:62% 50%;
    opacity:0.88;
    filter:saturate(0.78) contrast(0.95) brightness(0.86);
  }
  .story-note{
    position:absolute;
    left:34px;
    bottom:34px;
    z-index:2;
    max-width:245px;
    color:hsla(42, 31%, 91%, 0.72);
    font-size:12.5px;
    line-height:1.55;
  }
  .story-note b{
    display:block;
    margin-bottom:8px;
    font-family:var(--display);
    font-size:21px;
    line-height:1.05;
    color:var(--ink);
  }

  .bridge{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap:14px;
    margin:12px 0 54px;
  }
  .bridge-card{
    position:relative;
    min-height:172px;
    padding:20px;
    border:1px solid hsla(42, 31%, 91%, 0.10);
    border-radius:8px;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, hsla(208, 22%, 12%, 0.82), hsla(214, 25%, 8%, 0.72));
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .bridge-card::before{
    content:'';
    position:absolute;
    left:20px;
    top:20px;
    width:34px;
    height:34px;
    border:1px solid hsla(43, 75%, 68%, 0.36);
    border-radius:50%;
  }
  .bridge-kicker{
    display:block;
    margin-left:48px;
    margin-bottom:28px;
    color:var(--accent-b);
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:0.14em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .bridge-card h2{
    font-family:var(--display);
    font-size:20px;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .bridge-card p{
    color:var(--ink-dim);
    font-size:13px;
    line-height:1.55;
  }

  .section-head{
    display:flex;
    align-items:end;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:24px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
  }
  .section-head h2{
    font-family:var(--display);
    font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,42px);
    line-height:1.05;
    letter-spacing:-0.015em;
  }
  .section-head p{
    max-width:440px;
    color:var(--ink-dim);
    font-size:13.5px;
    line-height:1.55;
  }
  .chapter-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap:14px;
  }
  .chapter-card{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:58px 1fr;
    gap:20px;
    align-items:start;
    min-height:134px;
    text-decoration:none;
    color:inherit;
    border:1px solid hsla(42, 31%, 91%, 0.10);
    border-radius:8px;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, hsla(208, 22%, 12%, 0.9), hsla(214, 26%, 8%, 0.86));
    padding:24px;
    box-shadow:0 18px 44px -30px hsla(216, 70%, 3%, 0.9);
    transition:transform .22s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1), box-shadow .22s ease, border-color .22s ease;
  }
  .chapter-card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-3px);
    border-color:hsla(43, 75%, 68%, 0.34);
    box-shadow:0 30px 60px -34px hsla(34, 72%, 20%, 0.45);
  }
  .num{
    font-family:var(--display);
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:32px;
    color:var(--ink-faint);
    line-height:1;
  }
  .chapter-card:hover .num{color:var(--accent-b);}
  .card-title{
    display:block;
    font-family:var(--display);
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:20px;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    line-height:1.15;
    margin-bottom:9px;
    transition:color 0.18s ease;
  }
  .chapter-card:hover .card-title{color:var(--accent-b);}
  .card-blurb{
    display:block;
    font-size:13px;
    color:var(--ink-dim);
    line-height:1.6;
  }
  .serieslede{
    margin-top:26px;
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:12.5px;
    letter-spacing:0.02em;
    color:var(--ink-faint);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
  }
  .serieslede::before{content:''; width:20px; height:1px; background:var(--accent-b);}
  .serieslede b{color:var(--ink-dim); font-weight:600;}

  footer{margin-top:56px; font-size:11.5px; color:var(--ink-faint); letter-spacing:0.04em; line-height:1.7;}

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    .hero-action, .chapter-card{transition:none;}
  }
  @media (max-width:980px){
    .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr; min-height:auto; gap:34px;}
    .story-board{min-height:500px;}
    .bridge{grid-template-columns:repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));}
  }
  @media (max-width:720px){
    body{padding-left:18px; padding-right:18px;}
    .story-board{min-height:500px;}
    .story-image{object-position:68% 50%;}
    .story-board::before{
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, hsla(212, 23%, 6%, 0.82), hsla(212, 23%, 6%, 0.12) 46%, hsla(212, 23%, 6%, 0.56));
    }
    .story-note{left:24px; right:24px; bottom:24px; max-width:none;}
    .bridge{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .section-head{display:block;}
    .section-head p{margin-top:12px;}
    .chapter-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .chapter-card{grid-template-columns:48px 1fr; padding:20px; gap:16px;}
  }
  @media (max-width:460px){
    .hero-actions{display:grid;}
    .hero-action{justify-content:center;}
    .story-board{min-height:440px;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow">An interactive series</div>
        <h1 id="page-title">From the first circle to the quantum world.</h1>
        <p class="tagline">A story of mathematics told through one rotating point.</p>
        <p class="sub">Begin with Euclid's clean geometry: a radius, an arc, and an angle. Follow that motion through Newton's heavens, Fourier's waves, Euler's exponential, and Feynman's clocks, where probability itself is drawn with rotating arrows.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="hero-action" href="radian-circle.html">Start with radians</a>
          <a class="hero-action secondary" href="#chapters">Browse the story</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="story-board" aria-label="A pencil drawing of mathematical circles, waves, orbits, and phase clocks">
        <img class="story-image" src="assets/home-pencil-math-short-lettering.png" alt="Front-facing graph paper with short all-caps graphite formulas and hand-drawn circle, orbit, wave, phase, epicycle, and Fourier diagrams">
        <p class="story-note"><b>Geometry as a sketchbook.</b> The same circle keeps reappearing: first as an angle, then as an orbit, a wave, and a quantum phase.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bridge" aria-label="The mathematical story">
      <article class="bridge-card">
        <span class="bridge-kicker">Geometry</span>
        <h2>Measure a turn</h2>
        <p>A circle gives the first unit of rotation: the radian, where the arc and radius finally speak the same language.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="bridge-card">
        <span class="bridge-kicker">Astronomy</span>
        <h2>Predict the sky</h2>
        <p>Rotating geometry becomes a way to model repeating motion, from epicycles to Newton's sweep of planets through space.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="bridge-card">
        <span class="bridge-kicker">Analysis</span>
        <h2>Build any wave</h2>
        <p>Sines, cosines, and complex exponentials turn circles into a toolkit for sound, light, heat, and quantum state changes.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="bridge-card">
        <span class="bridge-kicker">Quantum</span>
        <h2>Sum the clocks</h2>
        <p>Feynman's path amplitudes bring the rotating arrow back: add the little clocks, then square the result.</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section id="chapters" aria-labelledby="chapters-title">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 id="chapters-title">Seven doors into the same idea.</h2>
        <p>Each chapter is a small interactive step in the larger arc: circle, wave, spiral, phase, and probability.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="chapter-grid">
        {% for part in parts %}
        <a class="chapter-card" href="{{ part.slug }}.html">
          <span class="num">{{ part.num }}</span>
          <span>
            <span class="card-title">{{ part.title }}</span>
            <span class="card-blurb">{{ part.blurb }}</span>
          </span>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="serieslede">Seven chapters to begin with — <b>the series is still growing</b>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
